1
00:00:00,750 --> 00:00:03,195
Everyone writes the same mistake.

2
00:00:05,150 --> 00:00:07,170
Cold comes in, they say.

3
00:00:07,250 --> 00:00:09,050
Watch.

4
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:13,490
Cold does not travel.

5
00:00:13,580 --> 00:00:15,611
Heat does. It leaves.

6
00:00:22,400 --> 00:00:24,932
Through the glass, warmth goes out.

7
00:00:31,200 --> 00:00:33,000
That is the lesson.
